  "body_text": "半年期的订阅链接已经开放\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n注意本次开放限时：6.18 00:00 - 6.20 23:59\n我先说几个事情，\n这次我们开放的是 “半年度”的订阅计划\n，全年度的订阅计划会在双11期间开放，这样做的原因是会跟我们现有的订阅用户的时间点重合，方便管理用户和生产；\n当前在执行中的订阅用户如果购买本次订阅计划，是在原有的期限上做延续6期处理，并非同时执行两个订阅而发放双份订阅豆；\n按照惯例，我们准备了一个神秘（\n自嗨模式开启\n）小礼物（价值¥166）作为对新老用户的认可支持的回馈；满足以下条件者会获得，1-新订阅用户；2-现有全年度订阅用户；特别的，如果现有全年度订阅用户续订，礼物也仅发放一份哦，不重复不累计；大促期间的\n满减赠品与小礼物二选一作为赠品发放，意思是选了满赠的豆子橙果瑰夏，就自动放弃小礼物咯～请谨慎作出您的选择：）\n现有订阅用户的小礼物会随本月度的订阅豆一起发出\n点击传送🫱\n‍\n‍\n公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）",
  "body_html": "<div class=\"rich_media_content js_underline_content autoTypeSetting24psection\" id=\"js_content\" style=\"visibility: hidden; opacity: 0; \">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          半年期的订阅链接已经开放\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;color: rgb(255, 104, 39);visibility: visible;\">\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n            注意本次开放限时：6.18 00:00 - 6.20 23:59\n           </span>\n</strong>\n</span>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;visibility: visible;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7STXjkL4we9WBkDInuo8feHwT9MJibFfnuBmpcJxDBQrH5JSA6nzicH8fltZawKRkfpgqCDmKywGwMw/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible !important;width: 677px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          我先说几个事情，\n         </span>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style='padding-left: 1.5em;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;list-styl